              expressions of praise/sympathy for Israelis</b></font></td>
            <td height="2" colspan="2"><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"></font></td>

            <td height="2" width="45%"><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"><b>Pro-Israeli 
              expressions of praise/sympathy for Palestinians</b></font></td>
          </tr>

          <tr align="left" valign="top"> 
            <td height="5" colspan="3"><font face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif"></font></td>
